	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. in domino.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Seculum nostrum vanos rumores perpetuo spargit, neque mirum, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>quum tot mendaces et hypocritas passim habeat, qui perpetuo aliquid excogitare <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>solent, quo aliis imponant, aut rumorum sint esse volunt autores, ut maiore <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>in pretio habeantur.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Heri accepi literas ab <placeName ref="l491">Argentina</placeName>, in quibus hęc inerant: <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><placeName ref="l18">Augustani</placeName> publico edicto, quod eques buccina insonans promulgavit in omnibus <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>civitatibus, qui ne dicat vel scribat Caesarem esse mortuum.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Quid putas <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>edictum velle?</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Episcopi electores <placeName ref="l976">Confluentię</placeName> sunt, ad quos properat <lb xml:id="p1z8"/><placeName ref="l1030">Herbipolensis</placeName> episcopus; tractabunt absque dubio de concilio futuro aut de com<lb xml:id="p1z9"/>muni pace <placeName ref="l822">Germaniae</placeName>.</s>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><persName>Caesar</persName> dissidet cum <persName ref="p18477">Ferdinando</persName>, hocque certissimum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>est, ob Caesaream dignitatem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Comitia <placeName ref="l546">Wiennę</placeName> instituta nondum sunt absoluta.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Papa concilium prorogavit usque ad Michaelis diem, et consensit Caesar; <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nam dixit se in propria persona <placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> puniturum gravissimis <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>poenis, quo extet exemplum apud posteros, nec addit "si dominus voluerit."</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z14"/>De <placeName ref="l3105">Mirandola</placeName> oppido nihilne audis?</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Spargunt apud nos fere fuisse prodita <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>ab monachis, qui conventum illic instituerunt provincialem; sed certiora <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>a <persName ref="p714">Coelio</persName> hac de re hauriam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z17"/>De <placeName ref="l2510">Turca</placeName> nihil nos amplius audimus, et quidam e <placeName ref="l546">Wienna</placeName> <placeName ref="l850">Au<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>strię</placeName> scripsit ad civem <placeName ref="l28">Basiliensem</placeName> omnia esse tuta apud eos nec timeri <lb xml:id="p1z19"/><placeName ref="l2510">Turcam</placeName> saevitiem hac aestate.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Quid igitur spargit has nugas?</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z20"/>Fortassis <persName>Caesar</persName> more solito bellum instituere conatur et ea specie colligere <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>militem, ut sic ex improviso suos hostes obruat vincatque, aut <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>pecunias emungere volunt ab simplici populo, quo commodius possit <lb xml:id="p1z23"/><placeName ref="l303">Magdeburgenses</placeName> expugnare aut nobis bellum inferre.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z24"/>Maxima annona carnis apud nos est; sed senatus noster consti<lb xml:id="p1z25"/>tutionem concepit, quam carnificibus proponet; si impressa fuerit, et tibi <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>mittam.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">Pestilentialis lues nondum cessare vult.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p8418">Myconius</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>optime valet, quamvis senio gravetur.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Hęc paucis, brevi plura<lb xml:id="p1z28"/>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/><placeName ref="l28">Basileę</placeName> 5. maii 1551.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">D. <lb xml:id="p1z30"/><persName ref="p8171">Theodorum</persName> nomine meo salutabis, <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>cui brevi prolixas lit<lb xml:id="p1z32"/>eras mittam.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la">T[uus] <lb xml:id="p1z33"/><persName ref="p1278">Gastius</persName> ex animo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Dem eherwürdigen <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>und hochgelerten herren <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>meyster <persName ref="p495">Heinrych <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Bullinger</persName>, lütpriester zuͦ <lb xml:id="p2z5"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>, mynem gun<lb xml:id="p2z6"/>stigen, lieben herren <lb xml:id="p2z7"/>zuͦ handen.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z8"/><placeName ref="l587">Zurich</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
